### Create Ticket

POST http://localhost:3000/api/ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title" : "ComputadorPrueba2",
    "id_department" : "1",
    "id_WorkTeam" : "1",
    "id_device" : "2",
    "id_statusTicket": "1",
    "id_priority" : "1"
}

